What was inherited
------------------
The frontend application — React components, GraphQL documents, page routing
and the overall product design — originates from Handan Web
(https://github.com/zven21/handan_web). The GraphQL schema this application
serves was likewise derived from the Handan backend's public API, so that the
original frontend continues to work against it.

What is original to this project
--------------------------------
The backend implementation in src/server is original work: the Handan backend
is written in Elixir using Phoenix, Absinthe and Commanded (CQRS/event
sourcing), whereas this implementation is TypeScript on GraphQL Yoga and Prisma
with a conventional relational model. It reproduces the same GraphQL contract
but shares no code with the original.

Also original: the database schema and migrations (prisma/), the operational
tooling in scripts/, the design system described in DESIGN.md, and the
documentation in AUDIT.md and DEPLOYMENT.md.

The MIT License covering the inherited portions is reproduced in LICENSE, as
that license requires.
